{"concept":"dance","groups":[{"id":"dance-scene","name":{"ru":"Танец, канат и образы движения","en":"Dance, tightrope and images of motion"},"count":32},{"id":"dance-teaching","name":{"ru":"Танец в учении и песне Жизни","en":"Dance in teaching and Life’s song"},"count":40}],"occurrences":[{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-6347ae67f8d6f32124ab9d0c9ccaf376","tos.text-unit.sid-6347ae67f8d6f32124ab9d0c9ccaf376"]},"form":"Tänzer","speaker":"saint","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"dance-scene","neighbours":["affirmation","nausea","saint"],"line":{"ru":"Святой узнаёт чистый взгляд и танцующий шаг Заратустры.","en":"The saint recognizes Zarathustra’s clear gaze and dancing step."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-fec3c8ac52ba7999af2cdf7b1a7d394d","tos.text-unit.sid-fec3c8ac52ba7999af2cdf7b1a7d394d"]},"form":"Seiltänzer","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"dance-scene","neighbours":["becoming","counterfactual","rope-bridge"],"line":{"ru":"Ожидание плясуна на канате собирает народ для первой речи.","en":"Expectation of the tightrope walker gathers the people for the first speech."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-4f5042155de21416a1cd6dbd02702bd1","tos.text-unit.sid-4f5042155de21416a1cd6dbd02702bd1"]},"form":"Seiltänzer","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"dance-scene","neighbours":["attention","laughter","rope-bridge","people"],"line":{"ru":"Народ обрывает речь ради ожидаемого зрелища.","en":"The people interrupt the speech for the expected spectacle."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-34c37793a8190de4d57eccbee29bfeca","tos.text-unit.sid-34c37793a8190de4d57eccbee29bfeca"]},"form":"tanzenden","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"people","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"dance-scene",