","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"dance-teaching","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2361d47be7cc97774c74e62856adf7e4","tos.text-unit.sid-2361d47be7cc97774c74e62856adf7e4"]},"form":"getanzt","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"dance-teaching","neighbours":["becoming","laughter","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c8e9e850b816f1db51f391e81ec26f51","tos.text-unit.sid-c8e9e850b816f1db51f391e81ec26f51"]},"form":"tanzt","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"animals","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"dance-scene","neighbours":["bestowing-virtue","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Имена и звуки освежают человека вещами; говоря, он танцует на всех вещах.","en":"Names and sounds refresh people through things; in speaking, they dance on all things."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-711dc06c5cfe15d63a5af8a9195a5638","tos.text-unit.sid-711dc06c5cfe15d63a5af8a9195a5638"]},"form":"tanzt","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"animals","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"dance-scene","neighbours":["zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f4bcee757dd64a17da7a137d3e99cd4c","tos.text-unit.sid-f4bcee757dd64a17da7a137d3e99cd4c"]},"form":"tanzen","speaker":"animals","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"dance-scene","neighbours":["identity","laughter","animals"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.14","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-5b91e7b1212678bfeb86ec212a262f80","tos.text-unit.sid-5b91e7b1212678bfeb86ec212a262f80"]},"form":"tanzen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra-soul","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"dance-scene","neighbours":["zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.15","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b